        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Obsidian Entertainment proudly presents the sequel to our crowdfunded and critically-acclaimed role-playing game, Pillars of Eternity. Welcome to Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire. With Pillars II, we are revisiting the rich narrative, beautiful environments, and tactical combat that made Pillars of Eternity one of the highest-rated PC games of all time.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Obsidian Entertainment presenta con orgullo la secuela de nuestro juego de rol, financiado mediante crowdfunding y aclamado por la crítica, Pillars of Eternity. Bienvenido a Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire. Con Pillars II volvemos a visitar la rica narrativa, los hermosos entornos y el combate táctico que hicieron de Pillars of Eternity uno de los juegos para PC mejor valorados de todos los tiempos.",
